# ============================================================================
# data/ — mixed shareability. Default to denying, allow only what we ship.
# (gitignore syntax does NOT support inline comments — keep notes above.)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IP-tainted (Hypergryph game corpus or derivatives trained on it):
#   raw/      — raw cn/ corpus + char_v3 wiki snapshots
#   clean/    — cleaned corpus (derivative of raw)
#   tokenized/ — tokenised corpus (vocab_* + qwen3 base)
#   checkpoints/ — from-scratch + CPT'd weights (trained on IP)
#   sweep_logs/  — training / probe logs (corpus snippets in probe outputs)
#   dpo_logs/    — Stage 05 training + probe logs (same shape as sweep_logs)
/data/raw/
/data/clean/
/data/tokenized/
/data/checkpoints/
/data/sweep_logs/
/data/dpo_logs/
#
# Rebuildable, large — keep out for size, not IP:
#   models/     — HF base weights (~1.2G, rebuildable from huggingface)
#   tokenizers/ — trained BPE tokenizers (~4M, rebuildable from clean/)
/data/models/
/data/tokenizers/
#
# LLM-generated training artifacts (SFT/DPO/RL chunks + merged files) ARE
# committed — they're transformative derived works of the broader lore, not
# raw text. See data/sft/, data/dpo/, data/rl/.
# ============================================================================

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
